      "writtenOn": "2025-09-10T20:52:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "my understanding is that Halla is needed for android 16 launching devices, for their entire support windows (7 years?), not just android16 kernels. i don\u0027t know exactly how that maps to kernel branches",
