      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T00:57:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@Frederick Mayle, Right, Halla is needed for android 16 launching devices and we have to support it 7 or 8 years including Andorid MR update. In this case, which branch do we have to use?",
      "parentUuid": "e4fc9925_b0152261",
      "revId": "574f279be6b50f8bc61c42d3e083caeb280d5ad8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a108f010_93e48cd6",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
